#: umain.rs100krows
msgid "100k rows — this time all 900k cells are **really filled**; compare \"stored cells\" against the million-row page above"
msgstr "10 万行 —— 这次 90 万格**真的全部灌满**；把「已存格数」与上面的百万行页对比一下"

